232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I also toured the control room of the 4 meter Dark Energy Survey telescope. It does a spectroscopic analysis of 5000 galaxies simultaneously and switches to another 5000 galaxies every 1000 seconds. At the 3.5 meter WIYN telescope I met the team doing detailed analyses of exoplanets discovered by the TESS telescope.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [21]
>>
